      "writtenOn": "2023-08-02T17:50:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we are now skipping before getting an int, we may change the behavior.\n\nbefore:\n```\nskip on p and null terminate p\nparse p_s\np_s \u003d p+1\n```\n\nnow:\n```\nskip on p\nparse p // NOT THE SAME !\np \u003d p+1\n```\n\nWhat do you think of simplifying a lot with :\n\n```suggestion\n  while (p \u0026\u0026 *p) {\n    // unconditionally parse as an int and advance p to the next char after it\n    uint16_t codec_modes \u003d strtol(p, \u0026p, 10);\n    // advance until next comma\n    p \u003d strchr(p, \u0027,\u0027)\n\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 117,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 128,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "4751b67fb63d91a6efbed394a1522840eec3e6ec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7a69fee4_8ca2ab6f",
        "filename": "system/bta/ag/bta_ag_swb.cc",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 128,
      "author": {
        "id": 1974186
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-03T11:35:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We are skipping but until a numeric character not until a coma.\nI was not sure how does this AT event look like, if it comes like: \"something,0,1,2,3\" I wanted to handle that, but you are right, it probably comes like: \"0,1,2,3\".\n\nI changed to your version and modified a little bit:\n```\n  while (p_s \u0026\u0026 *p_s) {\n    // unconditionally parse as an int and advance p to the next char after it\n    uint16_t codec_modes \u003d strtol(p_s, \u0026p_s, 10);\n    // advance until next comma\n    if (*p_s !\u003d 0) {\n      p_s \u003d strchr(p_s, \u0027,\u0027);\n      p_s++;\n    }\n```\n\nThis seems to work, but IF something wrong is passed, e.g.: \"x,0,1,2\" strtol wil return 0 for \u0027x\u0027, and we handle 0 in switch case - so not very safe solution. The current version simply skips anything other than number. Please let me know what you think.",
      "parentUuid": "50006844_83f5d1b6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 117,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 128,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "4751b67fb63d91a6efbed394a1522840eec3e6ec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a36c3bd2_d544aacd",
        "filename": "system/bta/ag/bta_ag_swb.cc",
